sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant PromptBox
  participant ChatStore
  participant GenerationApi
  participant RuntimeFactory
  participant ChromeRuntime
  participant WebViewRuntime
  participant CommonSSE
  participant Backend
  User->>PromptBox: 질문 입력
  PromptBox->>ChatStore: sendMessage()
  ChatStore->>GenerationApi: startGeneration(payload)
  GenerationApi->>RuntimeFactory: resolve runtime
  RuntimeFactory->>ChromeRuntime: Android Chrome streamGeneration()
  RuntimeFactory->>WebViewRuntime: Android WebView streamGeneration()
  ChromeRuntime->>Backend: POST /generation.do
  Backend-->>CommonSSE: SSE chunk
